1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,295
Yeh sheher sota nahi, bas
aankhein band karta hai

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:08,670
Har gali mein ek sapna,
har sapna yahan ladta hai

3
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,545
Rishi Shah... S-O-C-H

4
00:00:10,625 --> 00:00:11,920
Chal!

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,670
Zaban inki mitthi,

6
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,545
Aur gandi hai yeh soch,

7
00:00:15,625 --> 00:00:16,795
Paiso ke hai bhukhe,

8
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:18,670
Inki niyat mein hai khot.

9
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,795
Muh pe smile, peeche
chhuri, yahi inka trade hai

10
00:00:21,875 --> 00:00:24,920
Haath milaate dil se
nahi, sirf apne fayde se

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,045
Maine dekha asli chehra
jab andhera chhaya tha

12
00:00:28,125 --> 00:00:30,545
Jo kehte the "bhai bhai",
unka phone bhi na aaya tha

13
00:00:30,625 --> 00:00:33,670
Chilla chilla kar yeh haters kahenge,

14
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:34,920
What the fuck he has wrote?

15
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,795
I don't wanna stop,

16
00:00:36,875 --> 00:00:38,670
Jab tak inki badal jaati soch.

17
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:41,795
Notebook mein raatein
meri, pen se nikla dhuaan

18
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:44,920
Underpass ki deewaron pe
likha maine apna naam

19
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,795
Soch! Soch! Badlegi soch!

20
00:00:46,875 --> 00:00:49,920
Mitthi zaban, khota dil, dekh inki soch

21
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,795
Soch! Soch! Badlegi soch!

22
00:00:51,875 --> 00:00:55,545
Main na rukunga jab tak na badle inki soch

23
00:00:55,625 --> 00:00:58,045
Gali gali bole: Soch! (Soch!)

24
00:00:58,125 --> 00:01:00,545
Poori Mumbai bole: Soch! (Soch!)

25
00:01:00,625 --> 00:01:03,045
Haath upar, awaaz bada: Soch! (Soch!)

26
00:01:03,125 --> 00:01:04,920
Jab tak na badle: Soch!

27
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,420
Khade hain line me Q ki bade mere shows,

28
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:09,920
Ticket meri sasti Q ki
mehenge hai yeh log.

29
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,420
Basement ka mic tha, wahin se shuru safar

30
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:14,920
Bees log the pehle, ab
housefull har ek hall

31
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,045
Woh gine apne note, main
ginu kitne gaaye mere bol

32
00:01:18,125 --> 00:01:19,920
Unko chahiye daam, mujhe chahiye naam

33
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,420
Sasta mera ticket, par mehenga mera kaam

34
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:24,920
Local ki bheed mein
likhi maine har ek line

35
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,420
Pasine ki syahi, aur sabr mera sign

36
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:30,545
Jo bole "kuch nahi hoga",
woh aaj line mein khade

37
00:01:30,625 --> 00:01:33,045
Maine kuch nahi bhoola,
bas dil se hum bade

38
00:01:33,125 --> 00:01:35,545
Mic pakad ke bolun, yeh
shor nahi, yeh josh hai

39
00:01:35,625 --> 00:01:37,920
Har show mein ek hi naara:
badlegi yeh soch hai

40
00:01:38,125 --> 00:01:39,920
Ruk... saans le

41
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,795
Sheher sun raha hai

42
00:01:41,875 --> 00:01:45,545
Jo gira, wahi uthke chal raha hai

43
00:01:45,625 --> 00:01:47,920
Beat badal. Ab sun!

44
00:01:48,125 --> 00:01:50,545
Ab bhi hum shine karte
mere school waale dost,

45
00:01:50,625 --> 00:01:53,670
Rap sikhane waale mere college waale dost.

46
00:01:53,750 --> 00:01:56,170
Canteen ki table pe bani pehli beat

47
00:01:56,250 --> 00:01:59,295
Khaali jeb, bhari aankhein,
par irade the complete

48
00:01:59,375 --> 00:02:01,170
Jo the tab saath, wohi aaj bhi saath hain

49
00:02:01,250 --> 00:02:04,295
Sheher badle, naam badle,
par wahi haath hain

50
00:02:04,375 --> 00:02:06,170
Naqli log aaye jab chamakne laga naam

51
00:02:06,250 --> 00:02:08,670
Asli log the tab bhi, jab na tha koi kaam

52
00:02:08,750 --> 00:02:11,795
Loyalty ka rate kabhi market mein na girta

53
00:02:11,875 --> 00:02:14,295
Jo mehnat se bana, woh toofan se na darta

54
00:02:14,375 --> 00:02:17,420
Rooftop pe khade hum,
neeche sheher ki roshni

55
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:19,920
Yeh jeet sabki hai, sirf meri nahi akeli

56
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,420
Soch! Soch! Badlegi soch!

57
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:25,545
Mitthi zaban, khota dil, dekh inki soch

58
00:02:25,625 --> 00:02:28,045
Soch! Soch! Badlegi soch!

59
00:02:28,125 --> 00:02:31,795
Main na rukunga jab tak na badle inki soch

60
00:02:31,875 --> 00:02:34,295
Gali gali bole: Soch! (Soch!)

61
00:02:34,375 --> 00:02:37,420
Poori Mumbai bole: Soch! (Soch!)

62
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:39,920
School se college tak: Soch! (Soch!)

63
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,420
Stage se gali tak: Soch!

64
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:44,920
Jab tak na badle: Soch!

65
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,670
Soch badlo, sheher badlega

66
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:52,420
Mehnat bolegi, shor nahi

67
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:57,420
Gali se stage tak... yeh safar hamara

68
00:02:57,500 --> 00:02:59,920
Rishi Shah. Soch.
